@host = http://localhost:5160
@authToken = <your-jwt-token-here>
@userId = 1
@subscriptionUid = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@paymentMethodUid = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### 1. Obtener planes disponibles (activos)
GET {{host}}/api/payment/plans?activeOnly=true
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Obtener todos los planes (incluyendo inactivos)
GET {{host}}/api/payment/plans?activeOnly=false
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Obtener suscripción del usuario
GET {{host}}/api/payment/subscription?userId={{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Crear suscripción
POST {{host}}/api/payment/subscription
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "planId": 2,
  "autoRenew": true
}

###

### 5. Cancelar suscripción
PUT {{host}}/api/payment/subscription/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subscriptionUid": "{{subscriptionUid}}",
  "cancellationReason": "Ya no lo necesito por ahora"
}

###

### 6. Obtener métodos de pago del usuario
GET {{host}}/api/payment/methods?userId={{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 7. Agregar método de pago
POST {{host}}/api/payment/methods
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "type": "CreditCard",
  "provider": "Visa",
  "token": "tok_test_123456",
  "lastFourDigits": "4242",
  "expiryDate": "2028-12-31T00:00:00Z",
  "isDefault": true
}

###

### 8. Eliminar método de pago
DELETE {{host}}/api/payment/methods/{{paymentMethodUid}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###
